    "detailed_description": "[/url]\n\nPRO\u0106EMON is a retro-style procedurally generated monster collecting game. Everything is a glitch, all the time.\n\n[img][/img]\n\nEvery monster is procedurally generated and totally unique. All sprites, stats, flavor text, and attack moves are totally random.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\nFuse two Pro\u0107emon to make a new powerful Pro\u0107emon!\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[img][/img]\n\nUse the [b]Procedural Generator[/b] to journey to new worlds.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b]Battle enemies[/b] to level up your Pro\u0107emon or [b]charm enemies[/b] into joining your team. Every move, animation, sound, and special effect is procedurally generated.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\nEarn [b]badges [/b] by defeating the [b]Shareholders[/b] of the evil [b]Infinity Corporation[/b].\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid<br><br>PRO\u0106EMON is a retro-style procedurally generated monster collecting game. Everything is a glitch, all the time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/4ac364ae45138976a1c0f75ab0053737.webp?t=1677880705\" /></div><br><br>Every monster is procedurally generated and totally unique. All sprites, stats, flavor text, and attack moves are totally random.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/315cd335923fde55338f80d3125aac5b.poster.avif?t=1677880705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/315cd335923fde55338f80d3125aac5b.webm?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/315cd335923fde55338f80d3125aac5b.mp4?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fuse two Pro\u0107emon to make a new powerful Pro\u0107emon!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/b4720ee4f537dc3663d35f62e54fea48.poster.avif?t=1677880705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/b4720ee4f537dc3663d35f62e54fea48.webm?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/b4720ee4f537dc3663d35f62e54fea48.mp4?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/85df97e7df4dec04e7a89720b99a077d.webp?t=1677880705\" /></div><br><br>Use the <strong>Procedural Generator</strong> to journey to new worlds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/a666e89ada1718f1bbb7ddee55f9f1ab.poster.avif?t=1677880705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/a666e89ada1718f1bbb7ddee55f9f1ab.webm?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/a666e89ada1718f1bbb7ddee55f9f1ab.mp4?t=1677880705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Battle enemies</strong> to level up your Pro\u0107emon or <strong>charm enemies</strong> into joining your team. Every move, animation, sound, and special effect is procedurally generated.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets